    <!-- Platform limits disclosure (plan section 4) -->
    <string name="limits_title">Background delivery limits</string>
    <string name="limits_text">Delivery runs in the background when the phone is online. Ordinary app closure and reboots do not stop it, but: “Force stop” in Android settings blocks delivery until you open Clipshelf again; aggressive battery savers can delay it; clearing app data or uninstalling permanently deletes shares that were saved but not yet delivered. Nothing is lost on the server for shares already delivered.</string>

